# Bully Council Game

Bully Council Game is a small, solo-developed game made for my friend group, the Bully Council.

The game uses questions and a conspiracy-board-style interface to explore documented actions by governments. Each question includes its source so players can check the information for themselves.

This is an independent game project, not an official statement or a political organization. It is not intended as an attack on the people of any country.

## Play

[Play Bully Council Game](https://bully-council-game.onrender.com/)

## Sources

Each question includes a source for its information.

## Content Note

The game discusses disturbing real-world events.

